  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "北方的春本来就不长，还往往被狂风给七手八脚的刮了走。",
      "output_sha256": "f54f804360130567b4ab9fd1d6ada40d4fbed2728c62e7a5cdf6874e27da2c73",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "f54f804360130567b4ab9fd1d6ada40d4fbed2728c62e7a5cdf6874e27da2c73",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "济南的桃李丁香与海棠什么的，差不多年年被黄风吹得一干二净，地暗天昏，落花与黄沙卷在一处，再睁眼时，春已过去了！",
      "output_sha256": "50d8066cfa563f6124bffb5a15e07e31559f91133186d0bec0c78e11a667a170",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "50d8066cfa563f6124bffb5a15e07e31559f91133186d0bec0c78e11a667a170",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "记得有一回，正是丁香乍开的时候，也就是下午两三点钟吧，屋中就非点灯不可了；风是一阵比一阵大，天色由灰而黄，而深黄，而黑黄，而漆黑，黑得可怕。",
      "output_sha256": "3fa5d661273023adf12398a3bbc1078bdf72f946d69165424a1de8c6900f3b7d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "3fa5d661273023adf12398a3bbc1078bdf72f946d69165424a1de8c6900f3b7d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "第二天去看院中的两株紫丁香，花已像煮过一回，嫩叶几乎全破了！",
      "output_sha256": "aa86a1f8eed8e9c1dd7a8e61565a5879240c154359ece27968ad87f37ff0946f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "aa86a1f8eed8e9c1dd7a8e61565a5879240c154359ece27968ad87f37ff0946f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "济南的秋冬季节，风却很少，大概都留在春天肆虐了。",
      "output_sha256": "eb8a764a0069de1ef4ad54985c8b9476814cf214ce9a0367588f989d40a2058a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": 0.686582,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "8c0b3f649a1721398c359b4c9df2b3d800e6ed4f86ee169b4f04de4d1b5fa336"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_ai_sha256": "eb8a764a0069de1ef4ad54985c8b9476814cf214ce9a0367588f989d40a2058a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "有这样的风在这儿等着，济南简直可以说没有春天；那么，大明湖之春更无从说起。",
      "output_sha256": "06b560a45f051c7b1ad4cce4542c85cf03bacc99d2309b2d3520fadd1448f1f5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "06b560a45f051c7b1ad4cce4542c85cf03bacc99d2309b2d3520fadd1448f1f5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "济南的三大名胜，名字都起得好：千佛山，趵突泉，大明湖，都多么响亮好听！",
      "output_sha256": "8e24aa2fdd97b9a3c47ffc7323ce52cdee07ee0499b5956b03738520a28995d2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "8e24aa2fdd97b9a3c47ffc7323ce52cdee07ee0499b5956b03738520a28995d2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "一听到“大明湖”这三个字，便联想到春光明媚和湖光山色等等，而心中浮现出一幅美景来。",
      "output_sha256": "10b3333f06dedc4aa9dccc7d8e8bf82483db155e04dd1b251634bc015d910a19",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "10b3333f06dedc4aa9dccc7d8e8bf82483db155e04dd1b251634bc015d910a19",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "事实上，可是，它既不大，又不明，也不湖。",
      "output_sha256": "ba5493bff856dcea4fc5921af5246a7780ae61b51dbfdf05fdcc310e890a7329",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_human_sha256": "ba5493bff856dcea4fc5921af5246a7780ae61b51dbfdf05fdcc310e890a7329",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "湖中现在已不是一片清水，而是用坝划开的多少块“地”。",
      "output_sha256": "2c943ba5ab425eca7ed6c5f0ffae69dbdc6caa9d4cf978ac592b6041fd190036",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "2c943ba5ab425eca7ed6c5f0ffae69dbdc6caa9d4cf978ac592b6041fd190036",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“地”外有几条沟，游艇沿着这些沟而行，便是逛湖。",
      "output_sha256": "eeac7dfc6135a3b75fe32cb55b0e3f95d99295e3db990f6fa5017afe58e6ee1b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": 0.636947,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "17261ae1cf4e4ceebf42d92f540c953807c15d6309674e11a219d2d50677bd0a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_ai_sha256": "eeac7dfc6135a3b75fe32cb55b0e3f95d99295e3db990f6fa5017afe58e6ee1b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "水田不需要多么深的水，所以水黑而不清；也不要急流，所以水定而无波。",
      "output_sha256": "a9d6e6e96aab735b913f7cc3d7baaf9181f3768141dfd8c53665c0969aac5fd4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "a9d6e6e96aab735b913f7cc3d7baaf9181f3768141dfd8c53665c0969aac5fd4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "东一块莲，西一块蒲，土坝挡住了水，蒲苇又遮住了莲，远望去只见高低不平的“庄稼”。",
      "output_sha256": "9ac57db89f2cf8c6c871a79c159e15bec2b9a487416e4191d89e44ebe07a1b8b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": 0.790249,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "de460e92328cf0398d877cd5f5d6c448d8e6eabeb8d4e6fb5d10dc7be77158fa"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9ac57db89f2cf8c6c871a79c159e15bec2b9a487416e4191d89e44ebe07a1b8b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "艇行沟内，如穿高粱地然，热气腾腾，碰巧了还臭气烘烘。",
      "output_sha256": "fc89a9e078b40d8d35d8f01978fd65dbea7df575565d106cf46c994037802972",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "fc89a9e078b40d8d35d8f01978fd65dbea7df575565d106cf46c994037802972",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "夏天还算不错，假如水不太臭，多少能闻到一些荷香，且必能看到些绿叶。",
      "output_sha256": "26d4b731af8625d8600ff8277e2e64a8bcbddb2555f1bbafa22f1049a5168850",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": 0.717602,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "0a4261e1582b5b80389da66e91e65aed489bd956d5940785f735a0e943bf7646"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_ai_sha256": "26d4b731af8625d8600ff8277e2e64a8bcbddb2555f1bbafa22f1049a5168850",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "然而春天，水下是黑汤，旁边是破烂的土坝；风又那么狂躁，绿柳新蒲东倒西歪，似乎在拼命挣扎。",
      "output_sha256": "8f94418f653c5ca5f099f4cfaa9745d262653f7a11927c5afba94db6a7391f72",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": 0.624449,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "49a0e8251368ca9541125e3d5de6cfbf1cc582d63be9bbb43034e62ccf2502e4"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8f94418f653c5ca5f099f4cfaa9745d262653f7a11927c5afba94db6a7391f72",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "因此，它既不大，也不明，更不算湖。",
      "output_sha256": "e110b030f1dd7b4a883ca553805f8db3de51c571938da0d139791908627a3b94",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": 0.580949,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1199b10018874fe25b1d7360d0ef09d3333402f7fb5562f1d6cbb2b6b993b00f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e110b030f1dd7b4a883ca553805f8db3de51c571938da0d139791908627a3b94",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "尽管如此，这个湖依旧算得上名胜。",
      "output_sha256": "44f94c495b7242527a320e5fbededa11b6df225d16db8b684fd97bfefa516cf3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": 0.553571,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        18
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1f03a6f31305fc56b77156f79b400a6df23f40ce0a9387467b1e4c0369fcd1f7"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_ai_sha256": "44f94c495b7242527a320e5fbededa11b6df225d16db8b684fd97bfefa516cf3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        18
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "湖之不大与不明，都因为湖已不湖。",
      "output_sha256": "e40b93fc5b1f611db6cd3a4b7f967be54c669a8fc5dbb8f6510639a078924bae",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "e40b93fc5b1f611db6cd3a4b7f967be54c669a8fc5dbb8f6510639a078924bae",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "假若能把“地”都收回，拆开土坝，挖深了湖身，它当然可以马上既大且明起来：湖面原本不小，而济南又有的是清凉的泉水呀。",
      "output_sha256": "22c51a28f75bf8a737504db0a5f5d877a6326a1aa1b494c522c8b80cdc2a9252",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "22c51a28f75bf8a737504db0a5f5d877a6326a1aa1b494c522c8b80cdc2a9252",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这个，也许一时作不到。",
      "output_sha256": "c16e723d9c2182ce8176a8dd58d197f194a3f26bcf1dc62baa3d3ed96d012cbd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "c16e723d9c2182ce8176a8dd58d197f194a3f26bcf1dc62baa3d3ed96d012cbd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "不过，即使作不到这一步，就现状而言，它还应当算作名胜。",
      "output_sha256": "d0287943ea41760af17f31e33ff4131ae0a0e48e27af94a64542e3855eebecaf",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "d0287943ea41760af17f31e33ff4131ae0a0e48e27af94a64542e3855eebecaf",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "北方的城市，要找有这么一片水的，真是好不容易了。",
      "output_sha256": "42bdc6a0b69a378c6c92ebadfc60d64fc3f3bcd41d94e4c2ea6c844d35a8599b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_human_sha256": "42bdc6a0b69a378c6c92ebadfc60d64fc3f3bcd41d94e4c2ea6c844d35a8599b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "千佛山满可以不算数儿，配作个名胜与否简直没多大关系，因为山在北方不是什么难找的东西呀。",
      "output_sha256": "eb0344859c9630fbdc6fdacf4ba59673e9be326bc7c49f411c131a74530a8d80",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "eb0344859c9630fbdc6fdacf4ba59673e9be326bc7c49f411c131a74530a8d80",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "水，可太难找了。",
      "output_sha256": "21d4dfb00026ca7bd1c495513e069edceb05c44c5a2aeb2a127469bb79230725",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "21d4dfb00026ca7bd1c495513e069edceb05c44c5a2aeb2a127469bb79230725",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "济南城内有七十二泉，城外有河流，但湖却是必不可少的。",
      "output_sha256": "4d68832d9802ec99c57dc45e288ef56b95640253976abec9399352bc3de89d21",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": 0.632141,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        26
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "bdb52ebd0072e734de87ebd923fbf7f66e8b612ac399bd38b94cedc31a84a6bc"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_ai_sha256": "4d68832d9802ec99c57dc45e288ef56b95640253976abec9399352bc3de89d21",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        26
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "泉，池，河，湖，四者俱备，这才显出济南的特色与可贵。",
      "output_sha256": "586ed83d4440c07c49e8e702c3bd367a4d10ca8ed5d9f73fb02bbcec79e8d4d0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_human_sha256": "586ed83d4440c07c49e8e702c3bd367a4d10ca8ed5d9f73fb02bbcec79e8d4d0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "它是北方唯一的“水城”，这个湖是少不得的。",
      "output_sha256": "175a577c6f9788dc38ca165ecb1652a37befb41beaf3417748093c33a5fa8ffb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "175a577c6f9788dc38ca165ecb1652a37befb41beaf3417748093c33a5fa8ffb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "若我们游湖时，只见沟而不见湖，不妨去高处看看，比如在千佛山上向北眺望，就会看到城北灰绿的一片——大明湖；城外，华鹊二山夹着弯弯的一道灰亮光——黄河。",
      "output_sha256": "788d2a5d7483d55ed8e5754a030dc7980522a313496b0c53b43ad8ba343ae410",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": 0.764554,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        29,
        30
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5dcb172af6255d5fbfe6eb7e789459f2604b5e18bbf6a2b6c9d238a532c6f6f6",
        "d83c3133315149b3b17af4c544d1af73d29b7a9ce82671432942bf59771c5b2f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_ai_sha256": "788d2a5d7483d55ed8e5754a030dc7980522a313496b0c53b43ad8ba343ae410",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        29
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这才明白了济南的不凡，不但有水，而且是这样多呀。",
      "output_sha256": "17528f6f1c554c2f25f838e481826cafcce1d1690eaf518f26ad569eed89fca2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "17528f6f1c554c2f25f838e481826cafcce1d1690eaf518f26ad569eed89fca2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "而且，如果湖景不够美丽，湖中所产的东西却是相当珍贵的。",
      "output_sha256": "e216f2a5cb981d18e7730b5d26c375433864a65b8622291189f3ee12fdc0c996",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": 0.36616,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "84604dbe4bc7e9bc8741fbbc9673bb9ab4ef18db425a615597c22dc7f3fdb421"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e216f2a5cb981d18e7730b5d26c375433864a65b8622291189f3ee12fdc0c996",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        31
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "懂得美的人或许不如懂得美食的人多，游过苏州的往往只记得当地的点心，逛过西湖的人提起的必是那里的龙井茶、藕粉与莼菜等，吃到肚子里的或许比一瞥而过的美景更容易令人铭记。",
      "output_sha256": "969c280366233171080a8142b267573739c0d59bc8e56b92a1009a0255c123bc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": 0.708634,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        33
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6151f119efa989757ded8489e4474a34e140a95ff7e2f562245f7da1e4a0ed2c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_ai_sha256": "969c280366233171080a8142b267573739c0d59bc8e56b92a1009a0255c123bc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        32,
        33
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "而大明湖的蒲菜、茭白、白花藕，确实也是它驰名天下的重要原因之一。",
      "output_sha256": "cca60241fcc86a65cc6cf93b9a7c6a438e4108c7ebc7aaec2420ab3ffe8cee0d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": 0.708634,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        33
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6151f119efa989757ded8489e4474a34e140a95ff7e2f562245f7da1e4a0ed2c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_ai_sha256": "cca60241fcc86a65cc6cf93b9a7c6a438e4108c7ebc7aaec2420ab3ffe8cee0d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        32,
        33
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "不论怎么说吧，这些东西既都是水产，多少总带着些南国风味；在夏天，青菜挑子上带着一束束的大白莲花蓇葖出卖，在北方大概只有济南能这么“阔气”。",
      "output_sha256": "f00273e3094b4ccb08ddb36a47275fe30e5082cf2ea1124f6ace1850fe5d0d58",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "f00273e3094b4ccb08ddb36a47275fe30e5082cf2ea1124f6ace1850fe5d0d58",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我写过一本小说——《大明湖》——在“一·二八”与商务印书馆一同被火烧掉了。",
      "output_sha256": "ca1fc0532ad19fc95f68e1d3847bdf164109dd89ac62af07a5cacc58215ea080",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "ca1fc0532ad19fc95f68e1d3847bdf164109dd89ac62af07a5cacc58215ea080",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "记得我描写过一段大明湖的秋景，词句全想不起来了，只记得是什么什么秋。",
      "output_sha256": "7ea1e87818b51b21938c7d788d72db91d7b8ab32b85969f3d699307f6b088dfc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "7ea1e87818b51b21938c7d788d72db91d7b8ab32b85969f3d699307f6b088dfc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "桑子中先生给我画过一张油画，也画得是大明湖之秋，现在还在我的屋中挂着。",
      "output_sha256": "e6b8e513daf4c55406b2aa8fcfbc79456b7bde3641f9ace2ce2e81236bdfb6f1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "e6b8e513daf4c55406b2aa8fcfbc79456b7bde3641f9ace2ce2e81236bdfb6f1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我写的，他画的，都是大明湖，而且都是大明湖之秋，这里大概有点意思。",
      "output_sha256": "e976cd80e1c3b7006d0601a482314adb3822b6e98e35c673737a58f4f9fc6879",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "e976cd80e1c3b7006d0601a482314adb3822b6e98e35c673737a58f4f9fc6879",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "对了，只是在秋天，大明湖才有些美呀。",
      "output_sha256": "d26136af369e0c6015cc57aed6d3ed95ccd7ee0016b00b833375919626a1be0d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_human_sha256": "d26136af369e0c6015cc57aed6d3ed95ccd7ee0016b00b833375919626a1be0d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "济南的四季，唯有秋天最好，晴暖无风，处处明朗。",
      "output_sha256": "3057e3b61f9ba7cfb7e90972d57534c9700088d72e34dfcbc8475299eaee166d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "3057e3b61f9ba7cfb7e90972d57534c9700088d72e34dfcbc8475299eaee166d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这时候，请到城墙上走走，俯视秋湖，败柳残荷，水平如镜；唯其是秋色，所以连那些残破的土坝也似乎正与一切景物配合：土坝上偶尔有一两截断藕，或一些黄叶的野蔓，配着三五枝芦花，确是有些画意。",
      "output_sha256": "086acb35aea792bb2f515234ff388c6c5af018619b8b764de91bfa98cdb9f269",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_human_sha256": "086acb35aea792bb2f515234ff388c6c5af018619b8b764de91bfa98cdb9f269",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“庄稼”已都收了，湖显着大了许多，大了当然也就显着明。",
      "output_sha256": "86add91d0dab9e5875e10fcfdeb331898a7767019a42b7455f498db302fc9fe4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "86add91d0dab9e5875e10fcfdeb331898a7767019a42b7455f498db302fc9fe4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "不仅湖面宽阔水清，显得明丽，仰望南方，半黄的千佛山近在眼前，开元寺那边的“橛子”——大概是个塔吧——静静屹立在山头。",
      "output_sha256": "6282e2f8f4b49273d81a85a4f8b672bf4a7d38f320ce514f246711762e0264e3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": 0.67218,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        43
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2eb5db48f430db8cd9212244592f909175ff79f32662dc8fc3b0839bf39e28c1"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6282e2f8f4b49273d81a85a4f8b672bf4a7d38f320ce514f246711762e0264e3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        43
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "往北看，城外河水清澈，菜畦中生长着短短的绿叶。",
      "output_sha256": "afa710b62c88d387928442f0b0657e7afa2a8c2b3f7a1d2393a09713381381a6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": 0.743931,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        44
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b5df007d32d40db0e2daa8bbdb4d993a6a0defd33a468056f107ceb230ed4cbe"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_ai_sha256": "afa710b62c88d387928442f0b0657e7afa2a8c2b3f7a1d2393a09713381381a6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        44
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "往南往北，往东往西，四处都是开阔明亮的景象，有山有湖，有城有河，那个时候，我们真的得到了一个“明”字了。",
      "output_sha256": "07ec399b605f16016d7d9525c68be72de73dc22e0cfae2177334361a9ba88c43",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": 0.660048,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        45
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "729a2218d7a62beca94395fdf9a3891537406bdb3411750faec33f2e39f905f6"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_ai_sha256": "07ec399b605f16016d7d9525c68be72de73dc22e0cfae2177334361a9ba88c43",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        45
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "桑先生那幅画正是在北城墙上作的，湖边只有几株秋柳，湖中只有一只游艇，水面呈现灰蓝色，柳叶微黄。",
      "output_sha256": "157a625c6cc6d3633a53721d69100720e24bc63ca71f9cbee6aa1eee245acfb6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": 0.764462,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        46
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e7da6188525844633e51d0c47f168628ea202cc17a72a080214866c0fdfeaf71"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_ai_sha256": "157a625c6cc6d3633a53721d69100720e24bc63ca71f9cbee6aa1eee245acfb6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        46
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "湖外，他画上了千佛山，湖光山色，联成一幅秋图，明朗，素净，柳梢上似乎吹着点不大能觉出来的微风。",
      "output_sha256": "842b149b204c8a383a617c2b4a0bec1159d7c3e4d67df229aa47f9dc3f59d7ee",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_human_sha256": "842b149b204c8a383a617c2b4a0bec1159d7c3e4d67df229aa47f9dc3f59d7ee",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "对不起，题目是大明湖之春，我却说了大明湖之秋，可谁教亢德先生出错了题呢！",
      "output_sha256": "cb1286ee5167b56305088285eb83e08ebb3c2eef8412d72a1a71d2d60596ef6f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_human_sha256": "cb1286ee5167b56305088285eb83e08ebb3c2eef8412d72a1a71d2d60596ef6f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    }
  ]
}
